# Public Turnstile site key for the contact form. Safe to commit a real one —
# it appears in the page source by design. Without it the build falls back to
# Cloudflare's always-passes test key, which is fine locally and wrong in
# production. CI reads the same value from the GitHub Actions secret of the
# same name.
PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=

# Secrets are not set here. They are Worker secrets:
#   npx wrangler secret put TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY --env=""
#   npx wrangler secret put RELAY_KEY --env=""
